            <p class="club-entry__desc">Wear your values. Positive messages, purposeful design — pieces that say something beyond the aesthetic.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="club-entry__foot">
            <span class="club-entry__cta club-entry__cta--green">ENTER<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
